  "body": "#11228 was confusing to understand, because the API call to shutdown room does several different things at once. In that change I ended up introducing a bodge, allowing admins to use that endpoint to block a room that doesn't exist.\r\n\r\nI think there is a case for an admin API call that blocks this room and nothing else. (See also #2392).",
